## 5. Viewer Landing Page & Lead Intake Form
Create a clean, responsive HTML view hosted by Django:
- **Route**: `GET /claim-assistance/`
- **Features**:
  - Responsive layout (Tailwind CSS CDN).
  - Prominent Call CTA pointing to the tracked Vapi AI phone number (`tel:+18005550199`).
  - Simple Form fields: Full Name, Phone Number, Email, Short Message, TCPA Consent Checkbox.
  - **TrustedForm Integration**: Embed TrustedForm script tag in `<head>`, with `<input type="hidden" name="xxTrustedFormCertUrl" id="xxTrustedFormCertUrl_0">`.
  - Post submission: Show inline thank-you message and trigger background email dispatch.

