## 6. Email Handoff Service
Write a Django service function `send_lead_handoff_email(lead_instance)`:
- Renders an HTML email template containing:
  - Lead Type (Form vs Vapi AI Call)
  - Contact Details (Name, Phone, Email)
  - Incident Context & Location (if linked)
  - TrustedForm Certificate URL (for Form Leads)
  - Summary & Recording Link (for Call Leads)
- Sends email via `django.core.mail.send_mail` to configured `SUPPORT_EMAIL_RECIPIENTS`.

